The colors of this theme come from ayu:

- ayu-colors, the palette source (https://github.com/ayu-theme/ayu-colors),
  themes/light.yaml, themes/dark.yaml and themes/mirage.yaml at commit
  c6e86054896ef10c69ba899dc11fdad0e004d4d3 (package version 9.1.0), with the
  values resolved as the npm package ayu@9.1.0 has them (dist/generated).
- vscode-ayu, the VS Code theme (https://github.com/ayu-theme/vscode-ayu),
  ayu-light.json, ayu-dark.json and ayu-mirage.json at commit
  605c9c8504682854d77adc0b630742182a86676b (version 1.6.0).

The terminal colors are Ghostty's bundled "Ayu", "Ayu Light" and "Ayu Mirage"
themes; this pack names them and does not copy them.

